        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f563fe89-6ce6-32a1-9032-3b248b113961",
                "word": "bigfoot",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5c010068-c72d-3ffd-b242-cbd61e3ff853",
                        "entry_id": "f563fe89-6ce6-32a1-9032-3b248b113961",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Animal mythologique, hybride de primate et d’être humain censé vivre dans certaines régions des États-Unis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc2f999d-8863-4456-891b-67a40837a611",
                                "sense_id": "5c010068-c72d-3ffd-b242-cbd61e3ff853",
                                "text": "Quant aux échantillons provenant de six États américains, ils ne sont pas en reste : un raton laveur, un mouton, un cerf, un cheval, des ours noirs, des canidés (loup, coyote ou chien), des vaches… et un humain. Ces résultats ne feront pas les affaires de la vétérinaire américaine Melba Ketchum, de la firme texane DNA Diagnostics, qui prétend que son équipe détient des preuves génétiques irréfutables que le bigfoot est l’hybride d’une femme et d’un primate non humain."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c96d0c51-2549-4ba9-afd9-34b650e83ddb",
                        "source_entry_id": "f563fe89-6ce6-32a1-9032-3b248b113961",
                        "source_sense_id": "5c010068-c72d-3ffd-b242-cbd61e3ff853",
                        "target_lang_word": "Bigfoot",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Bigfoot",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "59c6d352-9fca-3bc1-a17d-bcf5fd82cf45",
                                        "entry_id": "0017ccaf-7f4b-3ab0-a3d6-1497736032a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "legendenhaftes Wesen mit riesigen Füßen, einer beträchtlichen Größe und starker Fellbehaarung, welches sich in Nordamerika befinden soll"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "910d61f7-1340-4ede-b197-bc2e019c58c6",
                                                "sense_id": "59c6d352-9fca-3bc1-a17d-bcf5fd82cf45",
                                                "text": "„Hobby-Forscher in den USA fahnden nach dem Bigfoot. Angeblich verrät sich die Kreatur durch Schreie und Spuren. Doch entdecken lässt sich das Affenwesen nicht.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d2b97d4a-b8b1-414d-a126-eb7943b43423",
                        "source_entry_id": "f563fe89-6ce6-32a1-9032-3b248b113961",
                        "source_sense_id": "5c010068-c72d-3ffd-b242-cbd61e3ff853",
                        "target_lang_word": "Bigfoot",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Bigfoot",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                        "entry_id": "d941fa36-0d07-3781-b40b-705b630aeb2b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A very large, hairy, humanoid creature, similar to the yeti, said to live in the wilderness areas of the United States and Canada, especially the Pacific Northwest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "572a0d96-300a-4af8-b49d-acee9d044a75",
                                                "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                                "text": "This imprint was made either Wednesday night or early Thursday morning by \"Big Foot\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc1fcdce-bc14-482e-9aab-42b258ed8367",
                                                "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                                "text": "Stories of “Bigfoot,” an eight-foot denizen of the forest in Northern California’s wild Trinity County, are among the main topics of conversation in that area. He is supposedly an Indian or half-breed who has reverted to an animal existence. A footprint believed to be his was measured by a Redding shoe store owner and found to be size 24!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38cad1c3-65af-4bbb-a63f-6ace24019300",
                                                "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                                "text": "Some Earth people believe Bigfoot lives in underground caves; others believe Bigfoot is connected with extraterrestrials; still others believe Bigfoot is a spirit that can sometimes manifest in form."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20c92238-a53c-4232-9244-c4ba66996392",
                                                "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                                "text": "The Bigfoot of spiders has been discovered in the caves of southwestern Oregon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "beac6bec-af2c-4f4d-ada0-3aff2710b3a0",
                                                "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                                "text": "Then there are the sharp divisions of opinion about whether Bigfoot is a Gigantopithecus or a Neanderthal or some other hominid."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9db8d40-2c18-49e8-9861-b8b91109ebca",
                                                "sense_id": "e58f52e5-e2c7-3651-aaf2-b13a4db7ec43",
                                                "text": "Many enthusiasts believe that Bigfoot is not some sort of undiscovered hominid, but rather a mystical being that moves between dimensions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Bigfoot",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "52cb2c40-7e41-37b1-9e07-deeb7bbe0196",
                                        "entry_id": "a386f46f-9f80-315c-88bb-2a511ae2cbf2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An individual creature of this type."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "127734ee-da6a-487c-a028-9f4cc16ad8c0",
                                                "sense_id": "52cb2c40-7e41-37b1-9e07-deeb7bbe0196",
                                                "text": "My answer to those who believe that all Bigfoot are just huge cuddly Ewoks is to remind them that there is plenty of evidence that every member of the great apes family […] has exhibited hostility […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81a8243c-2e6a-4a80-8850-1990df267049",
                                                "sense_id": "52cb2c40-7e41-37b1-9e07-deeb7bbe0196",
                                                "text": "The striking news on the appearance of a Bigfoot on Taibai Mountain in Xi'an, Shaanxi Provnice^([sic – meaning Province]) recently spread among local residents of Mei County located near the foot of Taibai Mountain. Is Taibai Mountain really home to a Bigfoot?\nWho encountered the Bigfoot on Taibai Mountain?\nReporters interviewed many residents of Mei County, and their accounts varied."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
